# `lib/`

Project-local libraries belong here, with one library per subdirectory. This
repository currently vendors `lib/CAN`, a patched MCP2515 CAN library with
20 MHz crystal support. It is intentionally local; do not add the upstream
CAN package to `platformio.ini`.

PlatformIO discovers libraries in this directory automatically. See the
[PlatformIO library documentation](https://docs.platformio.org/page/librarymanager/ldf.html)
for dependency-resolution details.